{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:100479","published":"2026-11-19T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-20T12:00:02.287519773Z","related":["CVE-2026-125707"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-125707"],"summary":"Moderate: gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free security update","details":"GStreamer is a streaming media framework based on graphs of filters which operate on media data. The gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free package contains a collection of plug-ins for GStreamer.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gst-plugins-bad: gst-plugins-bad: off-by-one write in MXF demuxer temporal offset table (CVE-2026-125707)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.16.1-10.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:100479.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.16.1-10.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:100479.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:100479"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-125707"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2569127"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/8/ALSA-2026-100479.html"}]}